{"title":"2013 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Find all real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> that satisfy <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/0/9006b0869a21f811906483f9787bfbb241f7ab53.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x^2 - \\tfrac{7}{2} x + \\tfrac{3}{2} )^{(x^2+7x+10)}= 1.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"218\" height=\"25\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>There are 3 cases in which <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/c/f8c0ad7ea831b8874f0193fda3b4a5941d773054.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x^2 - \\tfrac{7}{2} x + \\tfrac{3}{2} )^{(x^2+7x+10)}= 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"216\" height=\"26\" />, \n</p>\n<ul>\n<li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/f/5cf6d11805dbcbc70817886a1236e7033399707c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x^2 - \\tfrac{7}{2} x + \\tfrac{3}{2}) = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"143\" height=\"23\" />.</li>\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/d/a9df0bd31f5a3b387bd5501ff303e399ece10b88.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} x^2 - \\tfrac72x + \\tfrac32 &amp;= 1 \\\\ x^2 - \\tfrac72x + \\tfrac12 &amp;= 0 \\\\ x &amp;= \\dfrac{\\tfrac72 \\pm\\sqrt{\\tfrac{49}4-6}}{2} \\\\ x &amp;= \\dfrac{\\tfrac72 \\pm \\tfrac{41}{2}}2 \\\\ x &amp;= \\dfrac{7\\pm\\sqrt{41}}{4} \\end{align*}\" width=\"219\" height=\"203\" />\n<li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/5/cc5fd993b89462db0ae89dac636139ed797d878d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x^2+7x+10) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"149\" height=\"21\" />.</li>\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/d/8ad971df1ba43ef2c7fb74a6833495c7d3d6a9f7.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} x^2 + 7x + 10 &amp;= 0 \\\\ (x+5)(x+2) &amp;= 0 \\\\ x &amp;= -2, -5 \\end{align*}\" width=\"188\" height=\"69\" />\n<li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/6/41632eef0ab9e9b76606c5d922d60ac07d9b880e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x^2 - \\tfrac{7}{2} x + \\tfrac{3}{2}) = -1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"157\" height=\"23\" />.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/6/8464f816ae73919d2974744f702279b693e6ca15.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} x^2 - \\tfrac72x + \\tfrac32 &amp;= -1 \\\\ x^2 - \\tfrac72x + \\tfrac52 &amp;= 0 \\\\ x &amp;= \\dfrac{\\tfrac72 \\pm \\sqrt{\\tfrac{49}4-10}}{2} \\\\ x &amp;= 1, \\tfrac52 \\end{align*}\" width=\"228\" height=\"136\" />\nHowever, note that since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/3/dd30d341035874b46989c705b26f507a9e5bfd51.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(-1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"35\" height=\"18\" /> can be exponentiated to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/e/bae5aba07d37ff6ff813107e76260fb31ad5794e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" />, we must check for extraneous solutions.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/5/8a5772a9fee7bcf09b47257e4b84728e915af1c5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} (-1)^{1 + 7 + 10} &amp;= (-1)^{18} \\\\ &amp;= 1, \\end{align*}\" width=\"157\" height=\"44\" />\n\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/7/14741daf74311a72b86d8f824bcc5e65881d4793.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} (-1)^{\\tfrac{25}4 + 7(\\tfrac72) + 10} &amp;= (-1)^{\\tfrac{135}4} \\\\ &amp;= (\\sqrt[4]{-1})^{135} (\\ne1). \\end{align*}\" width=\"259\" height=\"57\" />\n</li></ul>\n<p>These cases give us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> solutions: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/e/8de38b291c284cb3c2a72e717c6297d73cda9f90.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{x=1,-2,-5,\\tfrac{7\\pm\\sqrt{41}}{4}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"173\" height=\"37\" />.\n</p><p>~pineconee\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_UNCO_Math_Contest_II\" title=\"2013 UNCO Math Contest II\">2013 UNCO Math Contest II</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems\" title=\"2013 UNCO Math Contest II Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Answer_Key\" title=\"2013 UNCO Math Contest II Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://uncmathcontest.wordpress.com/\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?titl